Error: Jet.UnusedPlaceMark: `count` neither changes nor takes `xs`, so it takes no `^`
  --> Tests/UI/writes_policy_call_marks.jet:14:19
    |
 14 |     print("{count(^xs)} {n}")
    |                   ^
 Why: `count: fn(items: [Int])` reads this input; a call mark applies only to a named argument the call changes (`^`) or takes (`^^`)
 Fix: Remove the `^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPlaceMark
